      "source": "This method returns [`true`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Swift/true) to indicate that the custom implementation handled the transaction and returns [`false`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Swift/false) to have the provider execute the transaction normally—as if the delegate did not implement this method.",
      "normalizedSource": "This method returns [`true`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Swift/true) to indicate that the custom implementation handled the transaction and returns [`false`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Swift/false) to have the provider execute the transaction normally—as if the delegate did not implement this method.",
